WEBVTT

00:34.800 --> 00:36.080
They say

00:37.440 --> 00:38.840
those who suffer pain

00:39.920 --> 00:42.200
will pass that pain on to others.

00:44.920 --> 00:47.680
So, do you want me to beat you,
or are you going to beat him?

00:49.480 --> 00:51.720
-Hurry up.
-I'm sorry.

00:52.840 --> 00:54.320
Harder.

00:54.400 --> 00:56.000
-That's still too soft.
-I'm sorry.

01:06.080 --> 01:07.280
That's because

01:08.000 --> 01:09.920
hurting others

01:10.480 --> 01:11.960
is the only way

01:12.560 --> 01:15.880
they can ease the pain in their hearts.

01:18.880 --> 01:20.040
Get up.

01:30.320 --> 01:32.400
Humans are so fragile,

01:32.480 --> 01:33.760
so weak,

01:34.280 --> 01:35.720
so pitiful.

01:46.120 --> 01:51.640
Will there ever be someone
who can stop this cycle?

01:51.720 --> 01:55.000
I WAS SO STUPID TO BELIEVE NANNO EXISTS

03:01.800 --> 03:05.320
DOES NANNO… EXIST?

03:05.920 --> 03:08.680
IS NANNO A GOOD PERSON?

03:10.360 --> 03:12.880
LEAKED PHOTOS OF MYSTERIOUS GIRL
RUMORED SHE IS "NANNO"

03:15.680 --> 03:17.080
Hello.

03:17.600 --> 03:18.920
THE NEW STUDENT

03:19.000 --> 03:22.040
WHO KEEPS TRANSFERRING
FROM SCHOOL TO SCHOOL?

03:22.120 --> 03:23.960
I'm Nanno.

03:25.760 --> 03:27.160
I'm a new student here.

03:27.240 --> 03:30.160
NANNO'S WAY OF REVENGE

03:30.240 --> 03:33.960
THEY SAY SHE LIKES TO TAKE
BRUTAL REVENGE ON BAD PEOPLE

03:35.640 --> 03:37.840
WHAT GOES AROUND COMES AROUND

03:40.520 --> 03:41.800
BITCH

03:43.600 --> 03:45.200
HOW CAN I FIND NANNO?

03:45.280 --> 03:47.800
IF SHE WANTS TO SEE YOU,
SHE'LL COME TO YOU HERSELF

04:06.160 --> 04:07.000
Nanno.

04:10.880 --> 04:12.360
Have you been waiting long?

04:13.200 --> 04:14.440
Let's go.

04:31.600 --> 04:35.000
YOU WANT TO MEET ME?

04:39.520 --> 04:41.800
HAHAHAHA

04:57.600 --> 04:58.760
Mr. Sky.

04:58.840 --> 05:02.240
During the exam the other day,
you didn't give me a single answer.

05:06.880 --> 05:09.320
Didn't a word I said get through to you?

05:23.880 --> 05:25.320
I'm giving you one last chance.

05:26.520 --> 05:30.840
My report has to score higher than yours.

05:42.440 --> 05:47.680
Sky, just do what Jom says.
I'm scared you'll end up dead.

05:49.200 --> 05:52.640
You're not Nanno,
who can take revenge on everyone.

06:15.600 --> 06:17.240
That's the way, buddy.

06:18.600 --> 06:20.920
Come on, I'll treat you to a meal.

06:21.000 --> 06:23.360
I'll submit the report first.
See you at the cafeteria.

06:25.040 --> 06:26.200
See you, buddy.

06:40.360 --> 06:43.240
YOU FUCKING BITCH TEACHER

06:45.240 --> 06:47.280
WRITTEN BY JOMPOL TEWARATTANAKUN

06:52.240 --> 06:53.600
I really don't understand.

06:53.680 --> 06:56.680
Why would you do this to Teacher On-usa?

06:57.760 --> 06:59.360
This is too much.

06:59.440 --> 07:03.040
This time,
I'll have to report this to your father,

07:03.120 --> 07:05.000
as well as your exam results.

07:08.480 --> 07:09.320
Hello.

07:11.000 --> 07:12.000
Yes.

07:13.840 --> 07:16.760
About Jompol, I'll handle it myself.

07:17.480 --> 07:20.720
Thank you, Teacher.

07:28.720 --> 07:30.200
Well, about--

07:30.280 --> 07:32.040
Don't talk about unpleasant things here.

07:35.960 --> 07:38.800
This is so damn embarrassing, you clown.

07:40.720 --> 07:43.440
Ja, how did the scholarship exam go?

07:43.520 --> 07:45.880
I received a full scholarship
which pays through my doctorate.

07:45.960 --> 07:50.040
Especially now that you're campaigning,
I want to help you however I can, Dad.

08:24.920 --> 08:29.200
You know,
I've never expected anything from you,

08:30.080 --> 08:31.920
so you don't need to apologize.

08:33.200 --> 08:35.840
Everyone should be able
to make their own choices,

08:38.280 --> 08:40.360
even trash like you.

08:44.160 --> 08:46.320
Left hand or right hand?

09:09.360 --> 09:11.400
Stop embarrassing me already,

09:12.120 --> 09:13.280
you clown.

11:19.280 --> 11:20.520
Look over there.

11:23.240 --> 11:24.440
Where are you?

11:32.240 --> 11:34.040
Where are you, buddy?

11:59.520 --> 12:01.080
There you are, you bastard.

12:14.280 --> 12:15.440
Okay.

12:16.480 --> 12:18.040
I only found this.

12:23.320 --> 12:24.400
You piece of shit.

12:31.160 --> 12:33.040
But trash like you

12:34.920 --> 12:36.440
deserves a choice too.

12:41.200 --> 12:42.400
Are you going to hit it,

12:44.360 --> 12:46.000
or should I beat you up instead?

12:49.760 --> 12:50.600
Choose.

13:07.080 --> 13:08.080
Well?

13:20.400 --> 13:21.400
Hey. Damn.

13:21.480 --> 13:23.200
You fucking idiot.

13:55.240 --> 13:56.800
This isn't over yet.

14:12.240 --> 14:13.320
What are you going to do?

14:20.360 --> 14:21.840
Take off his underwear.

14:25.680 --> 14:27.360
Don't, you asshole. Don't!

14:28.160 --> 14:30.680
-Damn you.
-Don't!

14:30.760 --> 14:33.080
No, no, no!

14:40.480 --> 14:41.440
What are you doing?

14:45.280 --> 14:46.280
Burn his hair.

14:50.680 --> 14:51.680
Hey!

14:52.680 --> 14:53.680
Hey, buddy.

14:53.760 --> 14:55.560
Don't!

14:59.600 --> 15:00.560
There's still some left.

15:28.040 --> 15:33.640
Audi told me you like to search
about how to get revenge, right?

15:36.560 --> 15:37.560
This right here.

15:39.320 --> 15:40.920
This is what you call revenge.

15:49.200 --> 15:52.680
Where's your Nanno? Go get her.

16:00.280 --> 16:01.960
The next time you dare to mess with me,

16:03.440 --> 16:04.760
you'll be famous.

16:07.000 --> 16:08.920
And you'll go through this every day.

16:09.960 --> 16:11.120
Every day.

16:12.560 --> 16:13.560
Every single day.

16:14.880 --> 16:17.920
But I'll always give
trash like you a choice.

16:20.800 --> 16:22.680
Either you obey me,

16:26.200 --> 16:28.040
or if you can't take it anymore…

16:31.200 --> 16:32.280
just go die.

16:40.400 --> 16:42.000
Look at your damn face.

17:05.880 --> 17:09.440
DAD, MOM

17:14.440 --> 17:16.160
If Nanno really doesn't exist,

17:17.040 --> 17:20.000
maybe my death

17:20.520 --> 17:21.560
will be the only way…

17:21.640 --> 17:22.560
DAD, MOM, I'M SORRY
SKY

17:26.320 --> 17:28.280
…to haunt him for the rest of his life.

17:33.840 --> 17:35.000
I was so stupid

17:35.640 --> 17:37.480
to believe Nanno exists.

18:43.440 --> 18:44.520
Hello.

18:45.040 --> 18:46.360
I'm Nanno.

18:46.880 --> 18:48.000
I'm a new student here.

18:48.600 --> 18:50.040
It's my first day.

18:50.880 --> 18:52.760
But I guess I came a little too early.

19:08.680 --> 19:09.880
Oh.

19:10.400 --> 19:12.160
Then I won't disturb you.

19:23.160 --> 19:24.200
Do you want me to help?

19:54.680 --> 19:55.920
Nanno?

19:57.000 --> 19:58.120
You're really Nanno?

19:59.360 --> 20:00.280
Of course not.

20:09.000 --> 20:11.600
Do you know how long
I've been searching for you?

20:14.640 --> 20:15.960
I know.

20:16.040 --> 20:18.120
I've already chatted with you.

20:24.880 --> 20:28.560
The other day,
I even sent you a clue about me.

20:29.440 --> 20:31.320
But you blocked me.

20:31.400 --> 20:34.240
GIRL FROM NOWHERE:
YOU WANT TO MEET ME?

20:34.320 --> 20:35.520
Oh.

20:38.400 --> 20:40.080
So in the end,

20:41.880 --> 20:45.280
are you stupid for believing I exist?

20:55.520 --> 20:57.240
If I didn't exist,

20:58.200 --> 20:59.960
that wouldn't be fun.

21:17.600 --> 21:18.600
Hello.

21:19.400 --> 21:20.560
That's great.

21:33.760 --> 21:34.600
Hey.

21:39.240 --> 21:40.440
What the hell is this?

21:42.920 --> 21:43.880
Who did this?

21:50.400 --> 21:53.680
Do you know what Jom fears the most?

21:57.520 --> 21:58.840
I asked who did this!

22:03.560 --> 22:05.640
It's the moment
when no one is afraid of him anymore.

22:32.480 --> 22:33.600
It was you, right?

22:35.800 --> 22:38.280
What's all this noise? Go sit down.

22:57.560 --> 23:00.640
Just sit down for now, Jompol.
I'll handle this.

23:04.080 --> 23:07.360
All right, everyone.
I have an announcement.

23:08.080 --> 23:10.760
Today, we have a new student joining us.

23:11.640 --> 23:12.760
Come in.

23:23.440 --> 23:26.240
Hello. I'm Nanno.

23:27.080 --> 23:28.320
I'm a new student here.

23:28.840 --> 23:30.360
Nice to meet you all.

23:34.360 --> 23:36.920
Go ahead and take any empty seat.

23:37.880 --> 23:39.000
Yes.

23:54.360 --> 23:57.880
All right, I'll hand out the test now.
Please focus.

24:27.760 --> 24:29.120
What are you doing, Jompol?

24:30.760 --> 24:32.280
What's that in your hand?

24:33.600 --> 24:34.600
Unfold it.

24:35.120 --> 24:37.720
I said unfold it.

24:43.120 --> 24:45.080
It's actually poop!

24:48.080 --> 24:50.240
-That's funny.
-Whose ass did he wipe with that?

24:50.320 --> 24:52.160
All right, quiet down. Continue your test.

25:17.200 --> 25:19.760
You said Nanno was behind all of this.
What do you mean?

25:21.840 --> 25:25.760
Sky told me before that Nanno
likes to take revenge on bad people.

25:28.640 --> 25:30.280
NANNO

25:31.960 --> 25:34.320
I don't see any info
on what you're talking about.

25:34.840 --> 25:36.840
But… but Sky told me.

25:39.320 --> 25:40.320
Forget it.

25:42.000 --> 25:43.800
If all of this came from her,

25:45.520 --> 25:47.440
then let's just say she started it.

26:01.120 --> 26:02.160
Hey!

26:30.520 --> 26:32.440
No need to hide, Sky.

26:37.360 --> 26:38.880
Or should I call it

26:39.400 --> 26:41.080
hiding behind a skirt?

26:44.520 --> 26:46.280
No one can help you.

26:49.200 --> 26:51.240
Not even that fucking Nanno bitch.

27:01.440 --> 27:02.680
Come out!

27:22.440 --> 27:24.200
What the hell are you joking about, Sky?!

27:24.280 --> 27:25.520
Why do you think it's me?

27:26.440 --> 27:28.480
Everyone in this school hates you,

27:29.800 --> 27:31.280
those two included.

27:32.040 --> 27:32.960
Where are you?

27:34.120 --> 27:35.600
I asked where you are!

27:41.040 --> 27:42.080
Hey, Jom.

27:42.600 --> 27:44.040
The hell is wrong with your hand?

28:02.160 --> 28:05.240
I re-dressed the wound.
It should be fine now.

28:07.080 --> 28:08.720
But if it hurts, lie down first.

28:54.360 --> 28:55.640
What the hell is this?

29:42.440 --> 29:44.560
COME MEET ME IN THE STORAGE ROOM

29:49.880 --> 29:50.880
Hey.

29:52.760 --> 29:54.240
What happened to your arm?

29:56.080 --> 29:57.920
Is that some new type of bandage?

29:58.000 --> 29:58.960
Pretty funny.

29:59.040 --> 30:00.520
What's so damn funny, asshole?

30:01.120 --> 30:02.200
Sorry.

30:10.720 --> 30:12.240
Mjolnir?

30:13.560 --> 30:15.880
Hey, are you making fun of my friend?

30:15.960 --> 30:17.520
The hell are you laughing at?

30:41.440 --> 30:42.720
Shut up!

30:46.680 --> 30:47.920
Get off me!

30:58.720 --> 31:00.560
Hey, where did the clown go?

31:02.760 --> 31:04.280
Isn't he right next to you guys?

31:08.480 --> 31:10.080
Ta-da!

31:11.920 --> 31:14.960
That doll isn't
as funny as you are anymore, Jom.

31:20.480 --> 31:22.920
Do you want to replace it?

31:28.400 --> 31:29.520
You…

31:39.160 --> 31:41.600
Your hand is so soft.

31:42.480 --> 31:43.880
It feels like

31:44.800 --> 31:45.960
I'm getting a massage.

31:58.240 --> 31:59.560
Aren't you going to film it?

32:00.160 --> 32:01.960
I think if this clip gets out,

32:02.040 --> 32:03.960
lots of your friends will laugh at it.

32:06.480 --> 32:07.400
Shut up!

32:07.480 --> 32:09.880
Shut up!

32:19.320 --> 32:20.960
You're really hurt now, aren't you, bitch?

32:23.520 --> 32:24.400
Film it.

32:24.480 --> 32:27.720
So anyone who dares mess with me
can see what they'll end up like.

32:38.000 --> 32:39.720
Are you done talking?

32:39.800 --> 32:41.160
I'm sleepy.

32:47.760 --> 32:49.200
Damn it!

32:50.960 --> 32:51.880
Shut up!

32:51.960 --> 32:53.400
What the hell is wrong with you?!

32:53.480 --> 32:55.480
Shut up!

33:04.840 --> 33:07.600
I'm so happy that we've started filming.

33:09.680 --> 33:13.160
From now on,
it's going to be even more entertaining.

33:21.120 --> 33:22.920
Let me tell you something.

33:23.520 --> 33:25.160
This will be a viral clip.

33:25.240 --> 33:27.360
Because it's the funniest, Jom.

33:32.120 --> 33:33.280
The hell are you laughing at?!

33:37.600 --> 33:38.880
Shut up!

33:39.960 --> 33:41.160
What?

33:46.640 --> 33:50.080
From now on,
you won't be just your father's clown.

33:50.960 --> 33:53.040
You'll be the entire school's clown.

34:02.320 --> 34:03.360
Enough…

34:05.840 --> 34:06.960
That's enough…

34:23.920 --> 34:25.240
Go on, post it.

34:26.240 --> 34:28.960
I know you've all hated Jom
for a long time.

34:29.960 --> 34:33.440
How many times
has he made you his victims?

34:40.040 --> 34:44.320
Humans aren't that hard to predict.

34:47.440 --> 34:49.480
Those who suffer violence

34:50.000 --> 34:51.760
pass violence on to others.

34:54.520 --> 34:55.960
And those others

34:57.000 --> 34:59.520
will continue passing it on.

35:25.800 --> 35:28.360
How is this enough
to repay what you've done?

35:28.440 --> 35:29.640
You bastard!

35:30.680 --> 35:31.880
You idiot!

36:04.200 --> 36:05.200
That's enough.

37:13.160 --> 37:15.000
I didn't expect Jom to cry like that.

37:15.600 --> 37:16.680
Really?

37:18.200 --> 37:20.040
I thought you knew everything.

37:20.760 --> 37:22.560
I just expected
a different kind of crying.

37:27.560 --> 37:29.120
Did I make the right decision?

37:30.200 --> 37:32.320
I just didn't want to become
the person I hate.

37:37.800 --> 37:40.000
What made you interested in me?

37:46.000 --> 37:47.040
Well…

37:49.280 --> 37:50.480
everything that you are.

37:53.120 --> 37:55.000
For example,

37:56.840 --> 37:58.840
you made me realize

37:59.520 --> 38:01.240
there are things we shouldn't give in on.

38:01.320 --> 38:02.800
And…

38:04.800 --> 38:06.880
you made me understand hope.

38:11.160 --> 38:16.080
Like, every problem
should be handled properly.

38:17.400 --> 38:21.160
Otherwise, you wouldn't come help me
and make things turn out like this.

38:21.240 --> 38:22.360
Right?

38:24.720 --> 38:27.120
But I don't think I helped anyone.

38:29.120 --> 38:32.000
But you helped me a lot.

38:34.880 --> 38:38.720
Actually, I gained a lot from you too.

38:42.160 --> 38:44.000
Do you want anything else from me?

39:00.720 --> 39:01.800
That's it?

39:05.400 --> 39:06.880
Would it be okay

39:07.840 --> 39:09.840
if I asked to stay by your side forever?

39:19.480 --> 39:21.520
You won't be able to find me, Sky.

39:48.360 --> 39:49.400
They've been upskirting us.

39:49.480 --> 39:51.200
You have to deal with them, Teacher.

39:54.920 --> 39:57.280
I'm Nanno. I'm a new student here.

39:57.360 --> 39:58.960
Why did you want to study here?

39:59.040 --> 40:00.440
The guys here are cute.

40:01.040 --> 40:02.560
And they're nice too.

40:03.160 --> 40:04.000
Nanno.

40:04.080 --> 40:06.360
I bet she could go for a high price.

40:06.960 --> 40:08.320
You don't have to secretly film me.

40:08.920 --> 40:11.840
If you just ask nicely,
I'd show you anyway.

40:14.000 --> 40:15.360
Take it.

42:08.840 --> 42:11.840
Subtitle translation by: Panuwat Baikeawon
